[106.232, "o", "\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1mRan 1 shell command, ran 4 web searchs, fetched 2 pages\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[90m  ⎿  WebSearch(Boiler Upgrade Scheme grant £7,500 air source heat pump England 2026 extended)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
