[306.593, "o", "\r\n\u001b[97m⏺ The report matches the model, and the check correctly fails when inputs differ. I'll tidy the page-one\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  wording next: sign handling, a clearer bottom line, and the clumsy \"never\" cell.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
